摘要中的主要功能必须被所选片段支持。优先把改变用途含义的条件写进摘要，不能只藏在limitations。遇到“阶段1骨架”“cloud provider待实现”“匿名thread后续实现”等，摘要明确当前仅本地草稿/审批落盘，不说已实现匿名网络或云端发布。Codex/模型登录适配归coding-development；Oopz等语音房的对话连接归communication-integrations。自述兼容或性能用“作者称/README注明”，不冒充本次验证。
格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"Song-dynasty aesthetics x Swiss International Style for the DeepSeek Harness web UI — rice-paper (light) and night-ink (dark) variants, celadon carrying interactive states, kiln copper reserved for blockquotes.","id":"gh:1382040645","install_available":true,"language":"JavaScript","name":"dsh-theme-songgrid","slug":"yefengliu1/dsh-theme-songgrid","topics":["deepseek-harness","dsh-plugin","dsh-theme","theme"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"Song-dynasty aesthetics x Swiss International Style for the DeepSeek Harness web UI — rice-paper (li"},{"id":"p1s2","text":"ght) and night-ink (dark) variants, celadon carrying interactive states, kiln copper reserved for bl"},{"id":"p1s3","text":"ight-ink (dark) variants, celadon carrying interactive states, kiln copper reserved for blockquotes."},{"id":"p2s1","text":"# Songgrid · 宋律"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"> Song-dynasty aesthetics × Swiss International Style — a theme for the **DeepSeek Harness** Web UI."},{"id":"p4s1","text":"中文 ｜ **English**"},{"id":"p5s1","text":"| Xuanzhi · light | Yemo · dark |"},{"id":"p6s1","text":"> The two variants, captured live (the sidebar is the Eight Standing Seats board). *Card areas are r"},{"id":"p6s2","text":" variants, captured live (the sidebar is the Eight Standing Seats board). *Card areas are redacted.*"},{"id":"p7s1","text":"## Why \"Songgrid\""},{"id":"p8s1","text":"The warm white of rice paper, the celadon of Ru ware, the warning red of cinnabar — disciplined by S"},{"id":"p8s2","text":"wiss International Style: a 4pt spacing scale, 2/4px radii, and type sizes locked to line heights."},{"id":"p9s1","text":"This is not ancient styling pasted onto a UI. Every traditional colour is **placed on the functional"},{"id":"p9s2","text":" role it can actually hold**."},{"id":"p10s1","text":"### Two accents, two jobs"},{"id":"p11s1","text":"The one decision in this theme that looks like a duplicate but must not be collapsed:"},{"id":"p12s1","text":"| Role | Colour | Contrast (on paper) | Where it lands |\n| --- | --- | ---: | --- |\n| **Functional**"},{"id":"p12s2","text":" · Ru celadon | `#3A7284`  | **4.91 : 1** ✓ AA | buttons · focus ring · selection · links |\n| **Edit"},{"id":"p12s3","text":"orial** · kiln copper | `#9A6B50`  | 4.19 : 1 | blockquotes · markers |"},{"id":"p13s1","text":"> Celadon passes WCAG AA, so it can carry \"can I click this / is this selected\". Kiln copper does no"},{"id":"p13s2","text":"t pass AA for body text, so it only carries \"is this worth a second look\".\n> Their hues sit **174°**"},{"id":"p13s3","text":" apart — they were never two candidates for one role."},{"id":"p14s1","text":"## Two variants"},{"id":"p15s1","text":"| Variant | id | Character |"},{"id":"p16s1","text":"| **Xuanzhi** (rice paper) | `song-grid-xuanzhi` | warm paper white × Ru celadon × cinnabar |\n| **Ye"},{"id":"p16s2","text":"mo** (night ink) | `song-grid-yemo` | cool blue-black × brightened celadon |\n| **Follow system** | `"},{"id":"p16s3","text":"system` | switches with the host |"},{"id":"p17s1","text":"## Palette"},{"id":"p18s1","text":"### Xuanzhi · light"},{"id":"p19s1","text":"| Role | Value | |"},{"id":"p20s1","text":"| Paper | `#F7F5EF` |  |\n| Surface +1 | `#FBFAF6` |  |\n| Surface +2 | `#F0EDE4` |  |\n| Overlay | `#E"},{"id":"p20s2","text":"7E3D8` |  |\n| Hairline | `#DDD8CB` |  |\n| Ink (primary text) | `#26221C` |  |\n| Secondary text | `#5"},{"id":"p20s3","text":"C554A` |  |\n| Tertiary text | `#8B8478` |  |\n| Brand / functional | `#3A7284` |  |\n| Editorial accen"},{"id":"p20s4","text":"t | `#9A6B50` |  |\n| Success | `#4E7A5A` |  |\n| Warn | `#B0823A` |  |\n| Cinnabar (error) | `#B5453C`"},{"id":"p20s5","text":"#9A6B50` |  |\n| Success | `#4E7A5A` |  |\n| Warn | `#B0823A` |  |\n| Cinnabar (error) | `#B5453C` |  |"},{"id":"p21s1","text":"### Yemo · dark"},{"id":"p22s1","text":"| Role | Value | |"},{"id":"p23s1","text":"| Night ink | `#10151A` |  |\n| Surface +1 | `#191F26` |  |\n| Surface +2 | `#1D242B` |  |\n| Primary t"},{"id":"p23s2","text":"ext | `#E8E3D6` |  |\n| Secondary text | `#A8A193` |  |\n| Tertiary text | `#7A7468` |  |\n| Brand / fu"},{"id":"p23s3","text":"nctional | `#7FB4C4` |  |\n| Error | `#D07A70` |  |"},{"id":"p24s1","text":"> The dark ground is a **cool** blue-black, tuned together with the celadon. Swapping it for a warm "},{"id":"p24s2","text":"black means re-tuning the entire dark variant."},{"id":"p25s1","text":"## Typography"},{"id":"p26s1","text":"- **Chinese** runs on a Song serif (`Noto Serif SC`); **Latin** stays sans-serif — each script gets "},{"id":"p26s2","text":"its own face, never mixed\n- Sizes are defined in pairs with their line heights (body / secondary / c"},{"id":"p26s3","text":"aption)\n- Emphasis comes from **colour roles** (celadon vs. kiln copper), not from stacking bolds"},{"id":"p27s1","text":"## Structure layers"},{"id":"p28s1","text":"Three layers; two of them are **orthogonal to colour** — future palette work never touches them:"},{"id":"p29s1","text":"| Layer | Contents | Colour |\n| --- | --- | :---: |\n| `STRUCTURE_CSS` | spacing scale (4pt grid + se"},{"id":"p29s2","text":"mantic aliases) · 2/4px radii · 4 line-height steps · 5 motion durations + 3 curves · focus ring · i"},{"id":"p29s3","text":"con sizes | no |\n| `ICON_CSS` | 46 Lucide mask icons, following `currentColor` | no |\n| `SEMANTIC_CS"},{"id":"p29s4","text":"S` | accent role split (`--sg-accent-functional` / `--sg-accent-editorial`) | yes |"},{"id":"p30s1","text":"## Install"},{"id":"p31s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p32s1","text":"Then **refresh the page** and pick 「宋律 · 宣纸」/「宋律 · 夜墨」/ follow-system under **Settings → General → T"},{"id":"p32s2","text":"heme**. The choice persists in the `song-grid-theme` settings namespace (the host plugin **entry id*"},{"id":"p32s3","text":"e**. The choice persists in the `song-grid-theme` settings namespace (the host plugin **entry id**)."},{"id":"p33s1","text":"> **The entry URL decides whether the choice survives across browsers.** The DSH client only writes "},{"id":"p33s2","text":"settings back to the host when the page hostname is `localhost` / `::1` / `127.x` (`isLoopbackHostna"},{"id":"p33s3","text":"me` in `dsh-client-connection`). Opened through `dsh.localhost`, a LAN name or a reverse-proxy domai"},{"id":"p33s4","text":"n, the whole settings surface degrades to in-page `memory` — which looks like \"I picked the theme, r"},{"id":"p33s5","text":"efreshed, and it was gone\", and it affects the official theme preference, locale and notification se"},{"id":"p33s6","text":"ttings just the same. To have the choice remembered across browsers/machines, open `http://localhost"},{"id":"p33s7","text":":8080/` (or `http://127.0.0.1:3080/?token=…`). Per-browser remembering works on any entry (the plugi"},{"id":"p33s8","text":"n keeps its own localStorage mirror)."},{"id":"p34s1","text":"## Compatibility"},{"id":"p35s1","text":"- Requires **DSH ≥ 0.2.0-rc.2** (`@deepseek-ai/dsh`); verified on 0.2.0-rc.2 — on 0.1.5-rc.2 install"},{"id":"p35s2","text":" `dsh-theme-songgrid@0.1.0`\n- Implemented purely by overriding host design tokens — **no host source"},{"id":"p35s3","text":" is patched**, no raw values\n- Not affiliated with DeepSeek"},{"id":"p36s1","text":"### Porting notes (0.1.5-rc.2 → 0.2.0-rc.2)"},{"id":"p37s1","text":"- `settingsScope` was removed: the theme preference scope is now `ctx.configForms.get(\"songgrid\")` ("},{"id":"p37s2","text":"the snapshot is still `{ status, value }`)\n- The built `lib/client.js` must register under the **pac"},{"id":"p37s3","text":"kage name** in `__ModuleLoader__.load({ id })` — rebuild the bundle after any rename, or the boot ab"},{"id":"p37s4","text":"orts with `duplicate factory registration`"},{"id":"p38s1","text":"## Development"},{"id":"p39s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p40s1","text":"- **Structure layer**: tokens live in `:root`; add a step there. New styles take `var(--sg-gap-*)` /"},{"id":"p40s2","text":" `var(--sg-radius-*)` — never raw values\n- **Icons**: `<span class=\"sg-icon sg-icon-check\"></span>`,"},{"id":"p40s3","text":" 46 glyphs in `ICON_CSS`; sizes via `.sm` / `.lg` / `.xl` or `--sg-icon-size`\n- **More editorial emp"},{"id":"p40s4","text":"hasis**: `--sg-accent-editorial` already exists in `SEMANTIC_CSS`; add selectors — the only rule is "},{"id":"p40s5","text":"**never on an interactive control**, that slot belongs to the functional accent"},{"id":"p41s1","text":"## License"},{"id":"p42s1","text":"MIT"}],"truncated":false}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
